Description: Controller-first media client for Plex, Jellyfin, Emby and Stremio
 Gamepad Media Center Aggregator (GMCA) is a native, controller-first client
 that brings your media servers to the devices their official apps ignore —
 game consoles and Raspberry-Pi-on-a-TV — behind one identical interface.
